cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Reaction in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Reaction: open geochemical reaction-path modelling"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Dougalien Systems"
version: 0.1.0
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
repository-code: "https://github.com/dougalien/Reaction"
abstract: >-
  Reaction computes aqueous speciation, mineral equilibrium, reaction paths and kinetics
  from the OBIGT (HKF) database of CHNOSZ, IAPWS-95 water and PHREEQC's pitzer.dat, with a
  browser interface for teaching and research.
keywords:
  - geochemistry
  - aqueous speciation
  - reaction path
  - thermodynamics
  - Pitzer
